## Technology Stack & Architecture

### Frontend Technologies
- **HTML5** - Semantic markup structure
- **CSS3** - Custom styling with CSS variables
- **Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+)** - Client-side logic with ES modules
- **Font Awesome 6.4.0** - Icon library
- **Google Fonts** - Typography (Inter, Playfair Display)

### Backend & Services
- **Firebase Authentication** - Custom Claims, Google & Apple OAuth
- **Cloud Firestore** - Real-time NoSQL database
- **Firebase Storage** - Image and media storage
- **Firestore Real-time Chats** - Peer-to-peer communication

### Payment Integration
- **Paystack** - Primary payment gateway
- **OPay** - Alternative payment method

### External Services
- **WhatsApp Business API** - Customer support integration
- **Email** - Contact via support@example.com
- **Unsplash API** - Placeholder images for categories

