## Challenges & Solutions

### Challenge 1: Image Upload & Storage
**Problem:** Large image files slowing down uploads

**Solution:**
- Client-side image compression before upload
- Resize images to max 1200px width
- Convert to WebP format
- Show upload progress bar
- Implement retry mechanism

```javascript
// Image compression function
async function compressImage(file) {
  const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  const img = new Image();
  
  return new Promise((resolve) => {
    img.onload = () => {
      const maxWidth = 1200;
      const scale = maxWidth / img.width;
      canvas.width = maxWidth;
      canvas.height = img.height * scale;
      
      ctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
      canvas.toBlob(resolve, 'image/webp', 0.85);
    };
    img.src = URL.createObjectURL(file);
  });
}
```

---

### Challenge 2: Real-time Cart Sync
**Problem:** Cart state inconsistent between localStorage and Firebase

**Solution:**
- Use localStorage as source of truth
- Sync to Firebase on auth state change
- Merge carts on login
- Debounce Firebase writes
- Handle offline scenarios

```javascript
// Cart sync logic
function syncCart() {
  const localCart = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('cart') || '[]');
  
  if (auth.currentUser) {
    // Merge with Firebase cart
    const userCartRef = doc(db, 'carts', auth.currentUser.uid);
    setDoc(userCartRef, { items: localCart }, { merge: true });
  }
}
```

---

### Challenge 3: Search Performance
**Problem:** Firestore doesn't support full-text search

**Solution:**
- Implemented client-side filtering for small datasets
- Created search index with lowercase terms
- Added debouncing to reduce queries
- Future: Integrate Algolia for large catalogs

```javascript
// Search implementation
const searchProducts = debounce((term) => {
  const lowerTerm = term.toLowerCase();
  const results = products.filter(p => 
    p.name.toLowerCase().includes(lowerTerm) ||
    p.description.toLowerCase().includes(lowerTerm)
  );
  displayResults(results);
}, 300);
```

---

### Challenge 4: Role-Based Access Control
**Problem:** Preventing unauthorized access to seller/admin pages

**Solution:**
- Check user role on page load
- Redirect if unauthorized
- Hide UI elements based on role
- Firestore security rules as backup

```javascript
// Role check
async function checkAccess(requiredRole) {
  const user = auth.currentUser;
  if (!user) {
    window.location.href = 'login.html';
    return;
  }
  
  const userDoc = await getDoc(doc(db, 'users', user.uid));
  const userRole = userDoc.data()?.role || 'buyer';
  
  if (userRole !== requiredRole && requiredRole !== 'buyer') {
    window.location.href = 'index.html';
  }
}
```

---

### Challenge 5: Mobile Navigation
**Problem:** Limited screen space for navigation

**Solution:**
- Implemented bottom navigation bar
- Sticky header with minimal items
- Hamburger menu for secondary links
- Swipe gestures for category browsing

---

### Challenge 6: Payment Verification
**Problem:** Ensuring payment was actually received

**Solution:**
- Server-side verification endpoint
- Webhook for payment confirmation
- Manual admin verification as fallback
- Transaction logging

---

### Challenge 7: WhatsApp Integration
